  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.firstdarkdev.xyz/partners/kal/kbp/kbp_header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"872\" height=\"174\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>以沙盒射擊遊戲的形式體驗Minecraft，融合了此類型遊戲的各種機制，打造出一個自訂殺戮模組包！<br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/upwFwYXxtA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.firstdarkdev.xyz/partners/kal/kbp/discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"381\" height=\"80\"></a><br></strong></strong></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.firstdarkdev.xyz/partners/kal/kbp/kbp_overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"872\" height=\"126\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用強大的工具、附魔，最重要的是，槍械來提升自己！自訂你的裝備，釋放出毀滅性、富有創意且回報豐厚的戰術連擊！</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">快速收集並更快戰鬥，透過簡便的合成與農耕改良，讓你輕鬆取得所有彈藥！</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">製造無人機、炮塔和超強狗狗來協助戰鬥，擊退成群敵人！</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過你所能想像的任何戰術優勢，擊敗極限Boss！</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">利用原版跑酷的簡單擴展，探索危險的結構與生態域！</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">安裝自己的伺服器，製作自己的地圖，並與朋友一起戰鬥！</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/880/433/capture.jpg\" alt=\"烈焰彈丸工廠\" width=\"240\" height=\"151\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/880/437/capture.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"148\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/880/449/capture.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"149\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/880/448/capture.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"223\" height=\"147\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/880/441/capture.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"147\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/880/440/capture.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"406\" height=\"171\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.firstdarkdev.xyz/partners/kal/kbp/kbp_trailer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"872\" height=\"126\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>（新預告片尚未決定）</strong></span></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.firstdarkdev.xyz/partners/kal/kbp/kbp_shaders.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"145\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">BSL（低階）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Complementary Reimagined（高階）<br>AstraLEX（復古模式）<br>TEA（原版增強）</span></strong></strong></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.firstdarkdev.xyz/partners/kal/kbp/kbp_credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"145\"></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Emma/Platy - PlatyPack 進度 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/platys-advancement-and-recipe-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">（在此處找到）</a></span></strong></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">戰鬥記錄防止 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fcombat-logging-prevention%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">（在此處找到）</a></span></strong></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Kubek - 夏季/沼澤/山地村莊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fmaquis-shrubland-villages-remastered%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">（在此處找到）</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fswamp-villages-5098284%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">（以及此處）</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fmountain-villages-new-structure-no-replacements-4901901%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">（還有此處）</a></span></strong></span></div><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">補充說明：</span></span></strong></h1><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">只需幾個簡單的安裝步驟，即可在VR和Steam Deck上體驗完整內容！</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Optifine 1.16.5 G8 相容<br>已最佳化並自動設定為10區塊距離遊玩。<br>建議配備：Nvidia GTX 970（AMD rx470）或更高GPU，以在使用BSL時達到可玩幀數（30至60+ fps）。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">最低配備：Nvidia GTX 570，以Optifine原版渲染達到30-60fps</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">目前預期整體效能約為同機器上原版效能的一半。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px;font-weight:400\">請分配約4GB的RAM，以避免最終出現記憶體相關的卡頓或崩潰。</span></strong></span></div>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
